{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Concept: Mechs as shells, guarding civilization.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ShellMobile</i> takes its name from the idea that tech\u2014like a nut protecting its pulp\u2014sees mechs, warships, and stations as life's shields. Upholding &quot;Machines for humanity,&quot; the company developed the <i>Titanium Rampart Defense System</i> after titanium refining breakthroughs, forming the unbreakable <i>Titanium Rampart Line</i> against aliens.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839810/extras/142006f993d3b2429d64055c3b5439c0.avif?t=1767775014\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Element: Titanium</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Titanium Lifeline</i>: Extraterrestrial titanium is humanity\u2019s tech foundation. Players send miners to extract it for defense upgrades and mech production.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Titanium Rampart Line</i>: 5th-gen alloy walls blend alien materials with quantum lattice tech, equipped with self-adaptive nano-repairs that instantly rebuild plasma-damaged structures and deploy antimatter against &quot;Ether-Eater&quot; flyers.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839810/extras/d57ddecb71312f30fea4700e3a59ef15.avif?t=1767775014\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay: Civilizational Clash, Tech Counterattack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a decade\u2019s hibernation, aliens return with &quot;Venomfang&quot; ground mechs (plasma drills) and &quot;Ether-Eater&quot; swarms (gravitational maneuvering). As commander, players must:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deploy Defenses</strong>: Install pulse EM cannons between titanium walls to intercept flyers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mech Strikes</strong>: Lead <i>Nut Shell</i> forces in &quot;Dawnbreaker&quot; mechs with antimatter missiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Warfare</strong>: Dispatch agile miners for rare titanium, refined by the Titanium Matrix into:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy Crystals (super units), Nano Components (repairs), Quantum Blueprints (tech unlocks).<br>Unlock weapons like Titanium Railguns and Dimensional Shields to fend off the horde.</p></li></ul></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Private","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839810/8321479267ff62c327867ab778a1ffe06370393f.jpg"},{"name":"Corporal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839810/8d54eaef9ac5e5cbbf9934850ac5301b4f99379b.jpg"},{"name":"2nd Lt.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839810/e0520c2c4d557bb4496b55e29dccaea5b51987f6.jpg"},{"name":"Major","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839810/072c9a1257e781dd6b9213135e6c283317f4b036.jpg"},{"name":"Maj. General","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839810/1c064371683dd45c9ef6f4fbb5dc4894fc3e1645.jpg"},{"name":"Marshal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839810/792048cbb78df2212d5d6dd216d6611403684f4d.jpg"},{"name":"Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839810/992e8d555a8d6ad7f61edfd643a7f425c2226499.jpg"},{"name":"Stardust Trial \u00b7 First Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839810/5f89791ae2b58b60a05fa9d57e0eb754a23f27a3.jpg"},{"name":"Dark Dust Duel \u00b7 Complete Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/ima